B.T3=new A.e0("Rule 2: Interrogative Sentences (Questions)",'Say/tell becomes "asked" or "inquired". Do NOT use "that". For yes/no questions, use "if" or "whether".',"She asked me whether I had verified the final answer key.","She said to me that whether I verified the final answer key.","Sentence structure changes from question form to assertive form.")
